@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Policy Ownership - Detail

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

artifact "docs/reference/taxonomy.md" as Taxonomy
artifact "configs/source_profiles.yaml" as Profiles
artifact "configs/task_categories.yaml" as Tasks
artifact "configs/quality.yaml" as Quality
artifact "synthesizers/prompts/categories/" as Prompts

[Prompt Planner] as Planner
[Phase 3 + 4 Validators] as Validators
[Distribution + Coverage Audits] as Audits

Profiles --> Planner : eligibility + pair caps
Tasks --> Planner : category + difficulty targets
Prompts --> Planner : task behavior
Quality --> Validators : IDs + bounds + gates
Tasks --> Audits : target distributions
Quality --> Audits : coverage groups
Taxonomy .. Quality : human and machine views agree

@enduml
